we have to put aside
some of our differences

00:18:14.259 --> 00:18:16.028
while we build the new stuff.

00:18:16.028 --> 00:18:18.564
While we build the
new internet pipes.

00:18:18.564 --> 00:18:20.999 align:start size:97% position:3%
While we build the new
businesses, Jeremy's Razors.

00:18:20.999 --> 00:18:24.169
While we build the new
entertainment companies,

00:18:24.169 --> 00:18:26.305
payment processors, the
whole freaking thing.

00:18:26.305 --> 00:18:29.041
Now, if we can really
build some good things,

00:18:29.041 --> 00:18:30.509
and of course they're
all gonna be built

00:18:30.509 --> 00:18:34.913
in red states obviously,
the question is after that,

00:18:34.913 --> 00:18:39.918
if we can get to that there
there, then what do we do?

00:18:41.353 --> 00:18:43.388
How do we then, once we've
