00:18:52.698 --> 00:18:54.533
Now, we're gonna have
to work through that.

00:18:54.533 --> 00:18:57.102
Again, I think the
founding documents

00:18:57.102 --> 00:18:59.471 align:start size:84% position:16%
give us the best
path forward to that,

00:18:59.471 --> 00:19:02.274
